  "description": "<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"412\">De <strong data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"90\">Dell Latitude 5410</strong> is een betrouwbare zakelijke laptop die bekend staat om zijn stevige bouwkwaliteit en goede prestaties. Dankzij de <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"233\">Intel Core i5-processor</strong>, <strong data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"256\">16GB werkgeheugen</strong> en een snelle <strong data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"284\">256GB SSD</strong> is deze laptop zeer geschikt voor werk, studie en dagelijks gebruik. Met <strong data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"385\">Windows 11 (Nederlands)</strong> kun je direct aan de slag.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"434\">💻 <strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"434\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q8rhnu\" data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"468\">\r\n<p data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"468\">💻 Model: Dell Latitude 5410</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h0ux92\" data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<p data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"499\">🖥 Scherm: 14-inch display</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164azpa\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"548\">\r\n<p data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"548\">⚡ Processor: Intel Core i5-10310U @ 1.70 GHz</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yfbpm5\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"578\">\r\n<p data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"578\">🧠 Werkgeheugen: 16GB RAM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xge35z\" data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"603\">💾 Opslag: 256GB SSD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"elicil\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n<p data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"646\">🎮 Grafische kaart: Intel UHD Graphics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nshbtn\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"686\">\r\n<p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"686\">📶 Connectiviteit: Wi-Fi, Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"si7amq\" data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<p data-start=\